  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a June 2026 post, the CIA listed \"broad AI adoption\" among factors it said were accelerating the Agency's mission speed and commercial access. The agency has highlighted AI-related expertise and leadership, including a 2025 recruitment post for people skilled in using AI to gain insights from data and 2024 references to its Chief Artificial Intelligence Officer. Earlier posts described AI and machine learning as part of the CIA's future and its partnership efforts.",
